WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.134 --> 00:00:22.106
Kip had someone to play with.

2
00:00:22.107 --> 00:00:25.622
But she didn't talk.

3
00:00:25.623 --> 00:00:29.335
"She's just shy," thought Kip.

4
00:00:29.336 --> 00:00:33.091
"Let's play hide-and-seek," said Kip.

5
00:00:33.092 --> 00:00:39.932
"I'll hide first!"

6
00:00:39.933 --> 00:01:04.793
Kip ran and hid behind a bench.

7
00:01:04.794 --> 00:01:07.508
But the person didn't find him.

8
00:01:07.509 --> 00:01:13.532
She didn't even look for him.

9
00:01:13.533 --> 00:01:18.606
"Let's play catch instead!" said Kip.

10
00:01:18.607 --> 00:01:22.178
Kip threw an acorn to the person.

11
00:01:22.179 --> 00:01:24.966
But the acorn bounced off her head.

12
00:01:24.967 --> 00:01:37.212
She didn't even try to catch it.

13
00:01:37.213 --> 00:01:41.198
Bird flew over.

14
00:01:41.199 --> 00:01:44.216
"What are you doing?" she asked.

15
00:01:44.217 --> 00:01:48.263
"I'm playing with my new friend," said Kip.

16
00:01:48.264 --> 00:01:50.704
"She's a small person."

17
00:01:50.705 --> 00:01:56.028
"Hi," said Bird. "What's your name?"

18
00:01:56.029 --> 00:02:00.268
"She doesn't talk," said Kip.

19
00:02:00.269 --> 00:02:09.997
Bird looked at the person closely.

20
00:02:09.998 --> 00:02:13.100
"What does she do?" asked Bird.

21
00:02:13.101 --> 00:02:17.791
"Uh, well, nothing really," said Kip.

22
00:02:17.792 --> 00:02:21.541
"You know why?" said Bird.

23
00:02:21.542 --> 00:02:25.290
"This isn't a real person.

24
00:02:25.291 --> 00:02:30.323
This is a fake person!"
